(cid:120) partnerships or other pass-through entities for U.S. federal income tax purposes;
(cid:120) persons who own or are deemed to own 10% or more of our voting shares;
(cid:120) persons who acquired common shares or ADSs pursuant to the exercise of any employee share option or otherwise as
compensation; or
(cid:120) persons whose “functional currency”is not the U.S. dollar.
